| B：Archtest/Allowlist Owner | 收紧 `dependency_direction_mcp_orch_test.go`，建 P23 archtest skeleton / names | `internal/archtest/*` |
| C：Runtime Contract Owner | 冻结 runner inventory、hook enqueue-only contract、StartDAG 最小归属 | 文档 + 小量接口草案 |

**合并顺序**：A → B → C。  
